OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband, who has already pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty to 60 offences against his wife,
OL,8,Falso admitted a fresh charge of rape
OL,9,Fand one of sexual assault. Both
OL,10,Foffences happened last summer.
